{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41905","headline":"送朐山孙明府赴寿阳幕府辟命 · 李中","name":"送朐山孙明府赴寿阳幕府辟命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堪羡元戎虚右席，便承纶綍起金台。\n菊丛憔悴陶潜去，莲幕光辉阮瑀来。\n好向尊罍陈妙画，定应书檄播雄才。\n预愁别後相思处，月入闲窗远梦回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}